    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16765" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσύμ-μετρος</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀξ-,</span>
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>incommensurable,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς μεγίσταις συμμετρίαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					87d
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Sens.</u>
				439b30
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				918b
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἡ διάμετρος καὶ ἡ πλευρά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1112a23
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ρως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					427
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>disproportionate,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				2.7
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. πρός τι</span>
			<i>disproportionate</i> to it, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>IA</u>
				708a15
			</span></i>; <i>ill-proportioned,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Po.</u>
				1461a13
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόμνημα</span>”
				<i>of excessive length,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Demetr.Lac.
					<u>Herc.</u>
					1014.67F.
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κινήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Mort.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ρως</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Attic.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Eus.
				<u>PE</u>
				15.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>unsuited,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς δημοκρατίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Per.</u>
					16
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Them.</u>
				22
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Phoc.</u>
					3
				</span></i>
			: c. inf., <i>not of fit size to</i> . . ,
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				719b12
			</span></i>.</div>
